  "description": "With the Altura CP you get a unisex electric bike with a low step-through frame. This makes it easy to get on and off the bike, especially when carrying extra weight, such as a front basket or a child seat on the back. The bike is equipped with the brand-new BOSCH Smart System, also called BES3 — a system that is quiet, comfortable, and efficient.\nThis model features the BOSCH Active motor. The battery is located in the rear carrier for easy access. The rear light is equipped with the Batavus BRAKE-light, which increases safety on the bike path by shining brighter when you brake.\nThis bike is available in cooperation with Fri Bikeshop.",
